Description: PBVR-based scientific visualization for 3D volume data
 CS-IS-PBVR is a scientific visualization application based on
 Particle-Based Volume Rendering (PBVR).
 .
 It supports volume rendering, isosurfaces, multivariate
 visualization, and 3D point cloud visualization for 3D volume
 data from simulations and measurements.
 .
 It also provides client-server and in-situ visualization for
 large-scale time-varying datasets.

